.TH GRID_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_init \- Reset a Grid: window at x,y, cells cell pixels apart with a 4\-pixel gap, cols across and rows visible, no items, selection \-1, clamping cursor, default colors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_init(Grid *g, float x, float y, float cell, int cols, int rows);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reset a Grid: window at x,y, cells cell pixels apart with a 4\-pixel gap, cols across and rows visible, no items, selection \-1, clamping cursor, default colors. Call in on_enter, then grid_set_count with the number of items; calling it again rebuilds the grid from scratch.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_set_count (3),
.BR Grid (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
